# Project UI Interactions

When building buttons, menus, cards, or any interactive UI in this project:

- Apply engineering foundations and `code/web/ui` first (reuse, accessibility, semantic elements).
- Load `.cursor/skills/project/ui-interactions/SKILL.md` for this project's motion and sound contract.

Key contract: `<motion.*>` with `whileHover`/`whileTap`; wire `playHoverSound`/`playClickSound` from `src/lib/sound/interactionSounds.ts`; fire `playMenuCloseSound` on every dismiss path; `aria-label` on icon-only buttons.
